{"id":"2121ca396d7d67ab","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-omega-enumeration.md","title":"The Omega-Consistency Enumeration Lemma","display":"lem-omega-enumeration — The Omega-Consistency Enumeration Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-omega-enumeration","aliases":["92-lem-omega-enumeration"],"display":"lem-omega-enumeration — The Omega-Consistency Enumeration Lemma","source":"第 V 章 p. 61，Lemma ω（PDF 78）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-enumerability-in-system]]","[[92-df-omega-consistency]]","[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-omega-enumeration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-omega-enumeration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-omega-enumeration — The Omega-Consistency Enumeration Lemma"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 p. 61，Lemma ω（PDF 78）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"58d4ef04d6476ad5\" href=\"?note=58d4ef04d6476ad5\" title=\"92-df-enumerability-in-system\">92-df-enumerability-in-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b15ebe94f199828c\" href=\"?note=b15ebe94f199828c\" title=\"92-df-omega-consistency\">92-df-omega-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9758d74f9a5e939a\" href=\"?note=9758d74f9a5e939a\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-representability\">92-df-smullyan-representability</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=\\exists v_1 F\">\\(H=\\exists v_1 F\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S},\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^1\">\\(\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S},\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^1\\)</span> 为系统内枚举与原书普通表示关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}omega\\text{-}enumeration}\\vdash\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}(F,A)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^1(H,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}omega\\text{-}enumeration}\\vdash\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}(F,A)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^1(H,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>成员处取可证见证实例并作存在引入。非成员处每个标准见证的负实例均可证；若存在句仍可证，则违反 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 一致性。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 的正实例可证当且仅当输入是成员。这里未得到非成员处存在句的否定可证，也未把结论改成完全表示。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 V 章 p. 61，Lemma ω（PDF 78）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-enumerability-in-system","status":"resolved","id":"58d4ef04d6476ad5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-enumerability-in-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-omega-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"b15ebe94f199828c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-omega-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-representability","status":"resolved","id":"9758d74f9a5e939a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"H=\\exists v_1 F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S},\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}omega\\text{-}enumeration}\\vdash\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}(F,A)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^1(H,A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false}],"bytes":1430,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]、[[92-df-enumerability-in-system]]、[[92-lem-omega-enumeration]]与[[92-df-omega-consistency]]给出原书关于表示和 $\\omega$ 相容性的契约。本地固定 PA 的对应结果见[[92-thm-first-incompleteness]]与[[92-thm-omega-incompleteness]]。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-240","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-lem-omega-enumeration]]"}],"outgoing":["58d4ef04d6476ad5","b15ebe94f199828c","9758d74f9a5e939a"]}